om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138780/extras/74db63760735cd4c6ef241af2aceb422.mp4?t=1722226147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Players at the beginning of the match are randomly assigned as either a &quot;Grabber&quot; or the &quot;Monster&quot;. Those who are selected as the Grabbers must find and <br>collect all of the cash, while the monster attempts to hunt them down. Both the Grabbers and the Monster are given a variety of abilities and options. After a Grabber has been killed, they will take control of a network of cameras throughout the map which control a variety of traps. The game ends after all Grabbers have escaped or been killed, or until the timer runs out.",
